# Marker: this build resolves from PUBLIC repositories only.
#
# A machine-global Gradle init script (~/.gradle/init.d/*.gradle) can inject a private, credentialed registry
# into every project on that machine, and a build cannot remove an init-script-added repository from inside.
# An init script that honours this marker skips this build entirely, so a bare `./gradlew` resolves from
# mavenLocal + Maven Central + the plugin portal, exactly as settings.gradle and build.gradle declare.
#
# Delete this file to build through such a registry on purpose, e.g. inside a network where it is the only
# reachable mirror. The deletion shows up in `git status` and affects this checkout only.
#
# See docs/BUILD-ENVIRONMENT.md.
